+//     every row of every M = 2..16 with the one-row result, bit for bit: 0
+//     differences on the Apple M5. Other GPUs, other Apple GPU families
+//     included, are not verified. A mismatch there could change output only
+//     at near ties.
+//   - The summation order of a row is fixed:
+//       lane l of k_lanes owns the B words w = l, l + k_lanes, ...;
+//       per word: acc_l += dot(a0, b0) + dot(a1, b1) (4 bits) or dot(a0, b)
+//       (8 bits);
+//       output = 0; output += acc_l for l = 0 .. k_lanes - 1; output += bias.
