+// pass is one tile. The row accumulators are separate variables (vec4, one
+// component per column of the thread), so they stay in registers: an
+// accumulator array indexed by a runtime row loop was kept in memory and
+// cost almost a full weight pass per extra row on the M5. Each accumulator is
